  "ruleText": "Lsa 403.02 Reinstatement. An applicant may bring an inactive license to active status by obtaining 30 continuing education hours within the immediately preceding 24 months.\n\nSource. #8861, eff 3-28-07; ss by #10679, eff 9-30-14; ss by #13850, eff 3-10-24",
